{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04768","headline":"送苏合宫頲 · 张说","name":"送苏合宫頲","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"都邑羣方首，商泉旧俗讹。\n变风须恺悌，成化伫弦歌。\n畴昔珪璋友，雍容文雅多。\n振缨游省闼，锵玉宰京河。\n别曲鸾初下，行轩雉尚过。\n百壶非饯意，流咏在人和。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张说","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04768.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04768","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}